# Toggle group

Toggle Group coordinates related toggle buttons. Use `type="single"` for one active value and `type="multiple"` for an array of independent values. Arrow keys move focus in the current orientation; Home and End jump to the first and last enabled item.

<DocsExample title="Toggle Group" source={toggleGroupExampleSource} htmlSource={toggleGroupExampleHtmlSource}><ToggleGroupExample /></DocsExample>

## Spacing and connected controls

Set `spacing={0}` to connect the items; the default is `2`. Each item inherits `variant`, `size`, and `disabled` from the group, but can override its variant or size.
